# The vendored prebuilt native runtime IS tracked: tools/check_repo.py
# allowlists exactly this prefix as an oversized-blob exception, the staging
# tasks in build.gradle.kts copy from here ("in-repo prebuilts"), and
# prebuilt/README.md documents its provenance. The repo-wide `*.so` ignore
# in the root .gitignore would otherwise silently drop every binary below on
# `git add`, so a fresh checkout gets a module whose server implementation,
# multimodal lib, Hexagon NPU backend, and DSP skels are missing at build
# time. Deeper .gitignore files override the root rule; this re-include is
# scoped to prebuilt/ only, so build outputs (build/, .cxx/) stay ignored.
!prebuilt/**/*.so
